# IsoRim animals batch odyfur1 (blob style): Greatwolf, Bog hound, Wolverine, Badger, Mink. Generated by
# tools/make_odyfur1_concept.py (v2); integrated 2026-11-18 (animals8).
# Kd = the sprite lit white (0.96); the textures hold the sprite colours relative to that white.
# Greatwolf, mink: untinted in vanilla, colours baked. Wolverine, badger: vanilla gives them a colour with CutoutComplex but
# ships no mask, so the game draws the sprites as they are (checked in game, 3D off): colours baked, no tintFromGraphic.
# Bog hound: white BogHound.png (dark mane baked) times the vanilla colour (ModelDef tintFromGraphic, Api 49: (123,104,89),
# the same for its three graphics BogHound_A / _B / _C), as the warg.
newmtl an_greatwolf_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/GreatWolf

